# text = I think you will agree with me , ( turning with a soft air to Emma ,) I think I shall certainly have your approbation , though Mr . Knightley perhaps , from being used to the large parties of London , may not quite enter into our feelings I know nothing of the large parties of London , sir -- I never dine with any body Indeed ! ( in a tone of wonder and pity ,) I had no idea that the law had been so great a slavery .
