# text = Think of me to-morrow , my dear Emma , about four o'clock Four o'clock !-- depend upon it he will be here by three Will Mr . Frank Churchill pass through Bath as well as Oxford My dear , dear anxious friend always overcareful for every body's comfort but your own ; I see you now in all your little fidgets , going again and again into his room , to be sure that all is right 'Tis twelve ; I shall not forget to think of you four hours hence ; and by this time to-morrow , perhaps , or a little later , I may be thinking of the possibility of their all calling here .
