# text = I do not know -- if you knew the harp , you might do all that , I am very sure ; but you sing as well as play ;-- yes , I really believe you might , even without the harp , stipulate for what you chose ;-- and you must and shall be delightfully , honourably and comfortably settled before the Campbells or I have any rest You may well class the delight , the honour , and the comfort of such a situation together they are pretty sure to be equal ; however , I am very serious in not wishing any thing to be attempted at present for me .
